 "description": "Use this when debugging a specific store's runtime behavior \u2014 why it updates too often, what actions trigger changes, or whether it emits errors. Returns recent events, change frequency, action calls, and errors. Omit storeName to get activity across all stores. Example: {storeName: \"$cart\", kinds: [\"change\", \"action-error\"]} or {limit: 20, windowMs: 60000}.",
